      "chunk_id": "text_3",
      "quote": "Hence, this study was aimed to estimate the pooled prevalence of medication-related problems and identify its predictors among cancer patients treated in Ethiopia.",
      "reason": "The text explains the need for the review by stating the aim to address the identified gap in knowledge regarding the prevalence and predictors of medication-related problems in the specific population."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e3",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
